Local changes for https://github.com/intent-hq/intent/issues/6364:
- collector.rs uses an anonymous tempfile::tempfile handle instead of
  NamedTempFile, so the process-global collector leaves no pathname at exit.
- Positional reads replace pathname reopening and leave the write cursor alone.
- Collector tests cover anonymous lifetime, repeated reads/appends and read errors.

All other shipped upstream files are unchanged. Cargo.lock, Cargo.toml.orig and
.cargo_vcs_info.json are omitted: the workspace lock and this file record origin.
The Cargo config patch applies to normal builds and release-plz's sanitized
package verification. The crate remains outside the workspace member list and
is still only a dependency on Unix. Remove this copy and override when upstream
ships an equivalent fix; retain the service process-exit regression.
